2026-10-05T01:18:08.3525779Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3631420Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3641535Z [0m
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3642164Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3646341Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3646893Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3647154Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3647664Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3648228Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3648422Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3648821Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3648996Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3649395Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3649918Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3651304Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3651853Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3652131Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3652391Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3652846Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3653191Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3653868Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3654089Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3654254Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3654515Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3655021Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3655884Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3656257Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3656397Z I will:
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3656600Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3656883Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3657548Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3658245Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3658867Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3659328Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3659770Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3660758Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3661742Z    /root
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3672839Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3673782Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3684993Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3686039Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3686667Z 
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3687215Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-05T01:18:08.3688046Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
